1
00:00:00,820 --> 00:00:04,369
Day one of
world domination.

2
00:00:04,409 --> 00:00:06,785
You said that yesterday.

3
00:00:06,825 --> 00:00:09,166
Yesterday was a rehearsal.

4
00:00:09,206 --> 00:00:16,175
Behold: the Adoration Ray.
One shot, and every creature
on Earth will adore me.

5
00:00:16,215 --> 00:00:17,831
Every creature?

6
00:00:17,871 --> 00:00:22,581
Every. Single. One.
On my count. Three...

7
00:00:23,351 --> 00:00:25,257
I said on my count!

8
00:00:25,297 --> 00:00:28,021
You were taking forever.

9
00:00:31,591 --> 00:00:33,129
It's working.

10
00:00:33,169 --> 00:00:34,918
It's pigeons.

11
00:00:34,958 --> 00:00:37,055
Pigeons are creatures.

12
00:00:37,425 --> 00:00:43,206
Stop. Stop looking
at me like that...
Okay, one more minute.

13
00:00:43,926 --> 00:00:45,803
Rent's due Friday.

14
00:00:45,843 --> 00:00:48,097
My army will handle it.

15
00:00:48,367 --> 00:00:50,856
That's a bottle cap.
